source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Issues a project-scoped key; prints its value once. Store it as a secret

Usage: leptoskit console token --project <PROJECT> --scope <SCOPE>

Options:
      --project <PROJECT>  
      --scope <SCOPE>      [possible values: read, deploy, ingest]
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
